            <title>Scale Shuriken Particle System</title>
            <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/scale-shuriken-particle-system/</link>
            <pubDate>Tue, 29 Nov 2016 00:00:00 +0700</pubDate>
            <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/scale-shuriken-particle-system/</guid>
            <description>&lt;p&gt;Unity does not provide a way to scale Shuriken particle system in Editor. The process to scale each particle system manually is very inconvenient.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;There are some plugins on the Asset Store which can help you with this tasks:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.assetstore.unity3d.com/en/#!/content/9703&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;Simple Particle Scaler&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.assetstore.unity3d.com/en/#!/content/4400&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;Particle Scaler&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;ve also written a tool to scale Shuriken Particles in the Editor: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/minhhh/unity-particle-scaler&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&#xA;    &gt;unity-particle-scaler&lt;/a&gt;. It&amp;rsquo;s very convenient and simple to use.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;</description>
